WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.220 --> 00:00:04.259
What happens when a Super Mario NES cartridge
is placed into The Clockworks?

00:00:04.259 --> 00:00:09.980
An NES cartridge for the game "Super Mario
Bros" was placed into SCP-914, on the setting

00:00:09.980 --> 00:00:15.820
1:1, and the resulting output was:
An NES cartridge for "Soopa Koopa Troopas."

00:00:15.820 --> 00:00:20.449
Game plays exactly like the input, but with
the player controlling a "Koopa Troopa," one

00:00:20.449 --> 00:00:22.810
of the turtle-like enemies in the original
game.

00:00:22.810 --> 00:00:26.810
Power-ups transformed the player character
into either a "Koopa Paratroopa" (same but

00:00:26.810 --> 00:00:31.050
with wings) or a "Hammer Bro" (larger enemy
that could throw hammers).

00:00:31.050 --> 00:00:35.070
Enemies are replaced with characters identified
as being from the game's "Mushroom Kingdom,"

00:00:35.070 --> 00:00:39.110
with Princess Peach taking Bowser's role as
the primary antagonist.

